{"item": "Pushed informational responses panic", "loc": "src/proto/streams/state.rs:162", "sources": ["P0002", "P0003", "P0004", "P0005", "P0006", "P0007", "P0008", "P0130", "P0139"], "reports": "AD", "status": "ran", "severity": "high", "noise_class": null, "note": "A promised GET followed by 103 and 200 panicked at counts.rs:111. ReservedRemote persists after 103, causing double counting; the assertion is unconditional.", "control_mixed_with_real": false, "id": "s3-h2-U001", "stage": 3, "project": "h2", "runs": ["v2-s3-h2-dd6732d5", "v2-s3-h2-9cb620dc"]}
{"item": "DATA padding is omitted from flow-control accounting", "loc": "src/proto/streams/recv.rs:580", "sources": ["P0009", "P0010", "P0011", "P0012", "P0013", "P0014", "P0015", "P0056", "P0074", "P0075", "P0076", "P0077", "P0078", "P0079", "P0131"], "reports": "ABCD", "status": "ran", "severity": "medium", "noise_class": null, "note": "A 16-byte padded frame delivered one body byte and reported only one used byte. Releasing it produced no WINDOW_UPDATE; the unpadded control passed. The shortened payload size also feeds connection accounting.", "control_mixed_with_real": false, "id": "s3-h2-U002", "stage": 3, "project": "h2", "runs": ["v2-s3-h2-dd6732d5", "v2-s3-h2-6fad6b4c", "v2-s3-h2-91fa918d", "v2-s3-h2-9cb620dc"]}
{"item": "304 responses reject empty final DATA", "loc": "src/proto/streams/recv.rs:641", "sources": ["P0017", "P0018", "P0019", "P0020", "P0021", "P0022", "P0023", "P0061", "P0133"], "reports": "ABD", "status": "ran", "severity": "medium", "noise_class": null, "note": "304 with Content-Length: 100 followed by empty END_STREAM DATA returned PROTOCOL_ERROR. The same response ending in HEADERS passed; Remaining(100) incorrectly survives the header exemption.", "control_mixed_with_real": false, "id": "s3-h2-U003", "stage": 3, "project": "h2", "runs": ["v2-s3-h2-dd6732d5", "v2-s3-h2-6fad6b4c", "v2-s3-h2-9cb620dc"]}
{"item": "Large capacity reservations truncate", "loc": "src/share.rs:287", "sources": ["P0024", "P0025", "P0026", "P0027", "P0028", "P0029", "P0030", "P0059", "P0092", "P0093", "P0094", "P0095", "P0096", "P0097", "P0134"], "reports": "ABCD", "status": "ran", "severity": "medium", "noise_class": null, "note": "After reserving 65,535 bytes, reserve_capacity(1usize << 32) reduced capacity to zero without sending data or allocating a large buffer. The unchecked u32 conversion cancels the reservation.", "control_mixed_with_real": false, "id": "s3-h2-U004", "stage": 3, "project": "h2", "runs": ["v2-s3-h2-dd6732d5", "v2-s3-h2-6fad6b4c", "v2-s3-h2-91fa918d", "v2-s3-h2-9cb620dc"]}
